ined components, as well as wire drawing products for other chain manufacturing plants, spring steel suppliers, and umbrella manufacturers. It markets its products under the Rolon brand. L.G. Balakrishnan & Bros Limited was founded in 1937 and is based in Coimbatore, India."}}